## Dashboard-Specific Generation Rules

### 1. Strict KPI Hierarchy
- **Typography Scale**: Core KPI value MUST be visually dominant using `<p class="text-3xl font-semibold tabular-nums tracking-tight">` (or `text-4xl`). Category title uses `<p class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground">`. Secondary context uses `<p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">`.
- **Universal Paragraphs**: Use `<p>` tags universally for all metric card text. Using `<span>` for text is FORBIDDEN.
- **Trend Delta Indicators**: Mathematical signs (`+` or `-`) alone are FORBIDDEN. Use explicit directional inline SVG icons paired with semantic colors (`text-emerald-600` / `text-rose-600`) and an accessible `<p class="sr-only">Increased by...</p>`.
- **Neutral Icon Wrapper**: Center card icons inside `size-10 rounded-lg bg-muted flex items-center justify-center text-muted-foreground`.
- **Micro-Chart Slot**: Sparklines must be constrained to `h-8` or `h-10` at the bottom of the card.
- **Card Ring Rule**: NEVER add `border` or `border-border` to `.card`. Basecoat `.card` provides its own subtle 1px ring and shadow elevation.

### 2. Table Scaffolding & Data Grids
- **Container Wrapping**: Wrap all tables in `<div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-md border border-border">`.
- **Sticky Headers**: Sticky header pins with `thead.sticky.top-0.z-10.border-b.border-border.bg-muted/50.backdrop-blur`.
- **Deterministic Alignment**: Numeric/currency columns MUST align right (`text-right tabular-nums`). Text columns align left (`text-left`).
- **Interactive Toolbars & Actions**: Precede tables with an integrated filter toolbar (search input, filter dropdowns, export action). Equip selectable tables with a bulk action bar.
- **Row Action Dropdowns**: Dropdown menus declare FSM `data-state="closed"` with trigger `aria-expanded="false"` and `aria-controls`.
- **Pagination**: Position standard-sized button controls beneath the table displaying current slice (e.g., "Showing 1 to 10 of 124 entries"). Never use `btn-xs`.

### 3. Responsive Container Wrapping & App Shell
- **Root Shell**: `h-screen w-full overflow-hidden flex bg-background text-foreground`.
- **Pinned Sidebar**: Desktop width strictly `w-64` (or `w-16` collapsed with tooltip mode), pinned at `md:sticky md:top-0 md:h-screen`.
- **Matched Header Heights**: Sidebar brand container and Topbar must strictly match heights (`h-12` or `h-14`) with seamless border alignment.
- **Independent Canvas Scroll**: The main content wrapper scrolls independently: `flex-1 flex flex-col min-w-0 overflow-y-auto`.
- **12-Column Responsive Grid**: Use `grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 md:gap-6`. Never place a single full-width card on desktop; use asymmetrical spans (e.g., `lg:col-span-8` + `lg:col-span-4`).

### 4. Mandatory FSM `data-state` Contracts
- `dialog`: `<dialog class="dialog" data-state="closed" data-fsm-recipe="dialog" data-fsm-state="closed">`
- `dropdown-menu`: `<div class="dropdown-menu" data-state="closed">` with trigger `aria-expanded="false"` and `aria-controls`
- `tabs`: `<div class="tabs" data-state="active" data-fsm-recipe="tabs" role="tablist">`
- `accordion`: `<section class="accordion" data-state="closed">` using `<details>` and `<summary>`
- `button` (submit): `<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" data-state="default">` transitioning to `data-state="loading"` with disabled attribute and SVG spinner
- `sidebar`: `<aside class="sidebar" data-component="sidebar" data-state="expanded|collapsed">`

