## Clean Generation Standards (Zero Muda)

1. **No Decorative Symbols or Emojis**: Unicode emojis are FORBIDDEN. Use clean inline SVG icons (Lucide / Phosphor SVG paths).
2. **No Redundant Explanatory Text**: Emit clean, executable markup and minimal structural summaries without conversational filler, restating instructions, or redundant prose around code blocks.
3. **No Duplicate Wrapper Containers**: Never wrap semantic landmarks (`<header>`, `<main>`, `<nav>`, `<aside>`, `<section>`, `<footer>`) or `.card` elements in superfluous `<div class="wrapper">` or unstyled `<div>` shells. Apply flex/grid/spacing utilities directly to the semantic element.
4. **Deterministic Class Ordering**: Order all Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes deterministically on every element:
   `Basecoat Component (.card/.btn/.input)` → `Layout (block/flex/grid/hidden)` → `Positioning (relative/sticky/fixed)` → `Flex/Grid Alignment (items-center/justify-between/col-span)` → `Sizing (w/h/size/max-w)` → `Spacing (p/m/gap)` → `Typography (text/font/tracking/leading/tabular-nums)` → `Surface/Background (bg-*)` → `Borders/Rings (border-*/ring-*)` → `Effects (shadow/opacity/transition)` → `Interactive Variants (hover:/focus-visible:/dark:)`.

### Tool Chaining Example
```json
// 1. Scaffold layout
{ "tool": "basecoat_page_architect", "arguments": { "intent": "Workspace Dashboard", "density": "compact" } }
// 2. Load technical & creative constraints
{ "tool": "basecoat_rules_enforcer", "arguments": { "category": "all" } }
{ "tool": "basecoat_creative_director", "arguments": { "topic": "all", "visitorJob": "operate", "stylePack": "vega" } }
// 3. Fetch FSM-bound component snippets
{ "tool": "basecoat_component_syntax", "arguments": { "component": "dialog", "state": "open", "environment": "html" } }
{ "tool": "basecoat_component_syntax", "arguments": { "component": "tabs", "state": "active", "environment": "html" } }
// 4. Audit final markup
{ "tool": "basecoat_quality_inspector", "arguments": { "code": "<header>...</header><main>...</main>", "densityProfile": "compact", "enforceFsm": true } }
```

